<% title 'Used to sign in with Facebook?' %>

<h1>Used to sign in with Facebook?</h1>

<p>Facebook login has been turned off on the forum, but your account, profile and posts are all still here. To get back in, give your account a password:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>If your account has an email address on it,</strong> use <%= link_to 'Forgot your password?', new_password_reset_path %> and we'll email you a link to set one.</li>
  <li><strong>If it doesn't, or the email doesn't arrive,</strong> email <%= protected_mail_to contact_email, subject: 'Claim my forum account' %> with your forum username and a link to your Facebook profile. We'll send you a link to set a password.</li>
</ul>

<p>After that, sign in on the <%= link_to 'login page', login_path %> with your username and new password.</p>
